.clojure-mcp/

# Credentials must never land in the repo. The server reads the key from an
# environment variable or an apiKeyFile outside the tree (see README), so a
# credential file appearing here is always a mistake.
.env
*.env
key
*.key
*.pem
secrets
*.secrets
run.sh
*.log

# Nix build artifacts (this repo ships a flake, so `nix build` drops these here)
result
result-*
